      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(1) The Departmental Modification form submitted by a department in accordance with Section 124 (a) and Section 124 (b) of the New York City Charter shall be approved or validated, as appropriate, by the Director of Management and Budget or his authorized representative and distributed as follows: two (2) copies to the Office of the Comptroller, one (1) copy returned to the Department for payroll entry, and one (1) copy to be retained by the Office of Management and Budget and used to up-date the Master Budget.",
